INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`Text`, `Text1`, `ID`, `LanguageID`, `ConditionID`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `ChatBubbleDurationMs`, `VoiceOverPriorityID`, `SoundKitID1`, `SoundKitID2`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
('The full story requires time that I suspect you do not have, so I will attempt to be brief.\r\n\r\nPerhaps the simplest way I can put it: these crystals are anchors. They can be used to permanently--well, so long as the crystals hold I suppose--bind something, someone, or even somewhere onto our plane of Azeroth. Prince Tortheldrin ordered the creation of similar pylons when he chose to bind the demon Immol\'thar. Some of the Shen\'dralar protested this decision and proposed a compelling alternative, but ultimately the prince was uninterested in debate and eager to silence dissent.\r\n\r\nI had an opportunity to study their design before it became too unsafe for me to stay within the city\'s walls and I fled back to Shen\'dralas.','',302214,0,0,0,256,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('The proposed alternative to demonic entanglement was at odds with what Tortheldrin had already set in motion. Given that he was working with power that tends to cloud one\'s judgment, it\'s no surprise that his first instinct was to lash out.\r\n\r\nMost everyone who pushed back against his plans to summon and bind a demon were slain that day. Some escaped, including some of my own kin that stood in opposition to the prince, but I have yet to meet other survivors of that schism even after all these thousands of years.','',302215,0,0,0,256,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('Ye\'ve come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around ye and ye shall fare far greater than most.','Ye\'ve come further than many, $n. Respect the elements around ye and ye shall fare far greater than most.',307408,7,0,0,257,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('They are going to see somethin\' really scary!','',310771,0,0,0,256,0,4,340110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('In the northwestern mountain range of Azshara, due north of the Ruins of Eldarath, there is an old passage that leads into the heart of Blackmaw Hold.','In the northwestern mountain range of Azshara, due north of the Ruins of Eldarath, there is an old passage that leads into the heart of Blackmaw Hold.',311268,0,0,0,256,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('The Blackmaw tribe holds this stronghold as their home. If you are journeying into northern Azshara, be on your guard, as the Blackmaw tribe is wary of all strangers as many of their kin have fallen to corruption and the animosity that we show them is returned by the Blackmaw as a measure of safety.','The Blackmaw tribe holds this stronghold as their home. If you are journeying into northern Azshara, be on your guard, as the Blackmaw tribe is wary of all strangers as many of their kin have fallen to corruption and the animosity that we show them is returned by the Blackmaw as a measure of safety.',311269,0,0,0,256,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('There\'s never an end to the chores around here.','There\'s never an end to the chores around here.',318923,0,0,0,256,0,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('Hidden within their impregnable stronghold of Ironforge mountain, they rarely ventured beyond the wintry peaks of Dun Morogh.','',329302,0,0,0,26,0,4,374739,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('Ruled by the child king Anduin Wrynn, the people of Stormwind remain steadfast in their commitment to the Grand Alliance.','',329312,0,0,0,26,0,4,374765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('Scattered across the lands, the wandering tribes were united only by their common hatred for their sworn enemy--the marauding centaur.','',329336,0,0,0,26,0,4,374791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938),
('The vicious trolls that populate the numerous jungle isles of the South Seas are renowned for their cruelty and dark mysticism.','',329343,0,0,0,26,0,4,374799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,70938);
